---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";

import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import news from "../../../data/news/news-2025.js";
import img_Featured from "../../../assets/news/2025/ladybugs-adoption.jpg";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
import { ClientRouter } from "astro:transitions";

const article = news[10];
const { author, title, content, img, date, id } = article;
---

<ClientRouter />
<Layout title=`${title} - Fallen Oak`>
  <div
    class="bg-[#fefce8] min-h-[calc(100vh-10rem)] px-4 lg:px-0 flex flex-col items-center"
  >
    <a
      class="mt-24 duration-300 hover:bg-blue-200 bg-blue-50 border-2 border-blue-200 hover:border-blue-400 rounded font-semibold text-base px-3 py-1 flex items-center gap-x-2"
      href="../"
      ><Icon name="mdi:arrow-back" class="text-2xl text-blue-600" />Back to News</a
    >
    <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 mx-auto py-8">
      <article class="px-6 mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-col gap-x-12 gap-y-8">
        <div class="flex justify-center w-full lg:w-full">
          <Image 
          transition:name={id} src={img_Featured} alt="News" width="400" class="object-cover w-auto h-64 border-2 rounded border-black" />
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-8 w-full lg:w-full">
          <div class="flex flex-col mx-auto gap-y-2 w-full">
            <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold leading-none whitespace-wrap">{title}</h1>
            <p class="text-xs lg:text-sm">
              by
              <span class="text-blue-400">
                <span>{author}</span>
              </span>on
              <time datetime="2021-02-12 15:34:18-0200">{date}</time>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-4 lg:text-base text-sm rounded border border-dashed border-black p-4 bg-amber-100">
            <!-- <p>{content}</p> -->
            <p>Are you looking for a 36 inch mini? We have a beautiful girl Ladybug, who is 18. This pony is so sweet and so pretty! She comes with 3 bags of her grain, she eats either Teff or Timothy hay, and needs to be on a dry lot or pasture with minimal grass, as she foundered 2 years ago. She is current on everything, is sound and ready to be a companion for anyone at her new home! Please conctact us if interested. Adoption fee is $500.</p>
            <p>UPDATE: Ladybug has found her forever home! She will be staying at our 2nd location in Ocala at the 40 acre farm. The owner of the farm has a 29 year old mini that needs a friend, and she asks that Ladybug stay to be her buddy. This lady is wonderful and allows the rescue to rent her property. I of course said yes, this is a win/win for everyone. Thanks to everyone who applied for this sweet little girl. I’m so excited that I will get to see her every day for the rest of her days. Congrats Ladybug on your forever home!</p>
        </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
